# secretlint ignore list (gitignore syntax).
#
# NOTE: MegaLinter only falls back to passing `--secretlintignore .gitignore`
# when this file is absent (see megalinter/linters/SecretLintLinter.py). Once
# this file exists it is used *instead* of .gitignore, so the secret-bearing
# patterns previously inherited from .gitignore are restated below.

# Go test fixtures. Credential-shaped literals in _test.go files are inputs to
# tests that assert such credentials are REJECTED or REDACTED -- URLs carrying
# embedded userinfo asserting that they fail closed, and PEM blocks asserting
# that non-RSA or malformed keys error out. The literal string is the subject of
# the assertion, so it cannot be removed or obfuscated without destroying the
# test. This mirrors the existing `.*_test\.go$` allowlist in .gitleaks.toml,
# which suppresses the same fixtures for gitleaks.
*_test.go

# --- Restated from .gitignore (see note above) ---

# Environment files
.env
.envrc
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

# Local certificates and keys
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# Configuration files that might contain secrets
config/local.yml
config/secrets.yml

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
/bin/
/dist/
/build/
coverage/
megalinter-reports/
tmp/

# Local development database files
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Logs
*.log
logs/
